    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——监牢生活第二轮，第四天。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——到今天为止，<br>\n我获得了许多关于被囚禁在这座监牢中的少女们的<br>\n魔法的信息。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——远野汉娜是【飘浮】。<br>\n——橘雪莉是【怪力】。<br>\n——城崎诺亚是【操纵液体】。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——宝生玛格是【模仿】。<br>\n——冰上梅露露是【治愈】。<br>\n——夏目安安是【洗脑】。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——紫藤亚里沙是【点火】。<br>\n——黑部奈叶香是【幻视】。<br>\n——佐伯米莉亚是【互换】。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——泽渡可可是【千里眼】。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——由于我认为独自手握这么多信息<br>\n，似乎对他人不太公平……", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——因此，我已经<br>\n将所有这些信息作为工作联络，<br>\n通过聊天APP分享给了其他少女们。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——虽然有些魔法<br>\n我并没有亲眼目睹，<br>\n还不能确定可信度有多高。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——但有一点令我在意的是……", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 40, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——樱羽艾玛的魔法是什么？", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv18_Narrative011"]}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 42, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
